tainty self-check skill (§3.4, §10.5 — 80% means right ~80%, separate measured vs inferred, explicit 'I don't know'); (m) Audit-log emitter tool for durable intent+evidence+approval+outcome trails; (n) Day-One bootstrap skill (§11.1 access + §11.2 document ingest + §11.3 first tasks). Each new tool MUST justify why existing tools (per Subtask 1's Association Map) are insufficient. Reference §1, §2.1, §2.7, §2.9 (PIR), §3.2 (AI Gateway, moderation), §3.4 soft competencies, §4.1 (runbooks), §5.1 (observability + orchestration), §5.3 (responsible-ai-api), §6.3 (SOP-3), §7 collaboration, §9 (challenges), §10.5 guardrails, §11 day-one of the role document.

