infrastructure; Subtask 2 reads local artifacts (role-doc sections, existing 
tool SKILL.md/tool.json, Domain Operational Artifacts) to produce the 
existing-tool inventory and capability-gap matrix that the parent task 
explicitly requires for every new-tool justification. Both subtasks enumerate
granular per-candidate work items so they stay concrete rather than vague. 
