## 5. The5 Critical Detectors for responsible-ai-api (OPP-202605-04)

### What it is
Issue [AI-264](https://hello.jira.atlassian.cloud/browse/AI-264) defines 5 specific detectors to be authored in `operations/terraform/`:

### How they map to Terraform resources

```hcl
# 1. P99 Latency Escape on prompt-moderation
resource "signalfx_detector" "prompt_moderation_p99_escape" {
  name = "${var.resource_name_prefix} P99 escape > 8s on prompt-moderation"
  teams = [var.signalfx_team_id]
  program_text = <<-EOT
    A = data('flask.micros.prompt_moderation.latency.upper_99',
        filter=filter('environment_type', 'prod'),
        rollup='max'
    ).max().publish(label='A')detect(when(A > threshold(8000), lasting='2m')).publish('P99 > 8s prompt-moderation')
  EOT
  rule {
    detect_label = "P99 > 8s prompt-moderation"
    severity     = "Critical"
    notifications = ["Opsgenie,D2c_4qUA4AA,<team>,<team_uuid>,Team"]
    runbook_url  = "<runbook_url>"
  }
}

# 2. Image moderation 5xx rate
resource "signalfx_detector" "image_moderation_5xx" {
  name = "${var.resource_name_prefix} Image moderation HTTP 5xx > 500/min"
  program_text = <<-EOT
    A = data('http.server.requests.count',
        filter=filter('environment_type', 'prod')
            and filter('norm_uri', '/v1/moderation/image')
            and filter('http_status_code_group', '5xx'),
        rollup='sum'
    ).sum().publish(label='A')
    detect(when(A > threshold(500), lasting='1m')).publish('Image 5xx > 500/min')
  EOT
  rule { ... }
}

# 3. Teamserve DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
resource "signalfx_detector" "teamserve_deadline_exceeded" { ... }

# 4. ALB unhealthy host count
resource "signalfx_detector" "alb_unhealthy_hosts" { ... }

# 5. Fail-open warnings
resource "signalfx_detector" "fail_open_warnings" { ... }
```

### Proposed approach (from the ticket)
1. Author detector resources in `operations/terraform/detectors.tf` (or a new file)
2. Plumb to OpsGenie team integration
3. Start with **conservative thresholds** slightly above current baseline noise
4. Tighten thresholds after2weeks of false-positive observation
5. Require a **per-detector runbook-link annotation**

**Source**: [OPP-202605-04](https://hello.jira.atlassian.cloud/browse/AI-264)

