## 8. Advanced Patterns: Modules, Burn Rate, and Reusability

### Reusable Module Pattern (Atlassian-wide monitoring modules)
```hcl
module "reliability_burn_rate" {
  source          = "git::ssh://git@bitbucket.org/atlassian/atlassian-monitoring-terraform-modules.git//burn_rate_detectors?ref=9.7.1"
  detector_label  = "${var.resource_name_prefix} - reliability"
  teams           = [var.team]
  objective       = 99.9
  success_events  = { genericCount = var.success_events }
  failure_events= { genericCount = var.failure_events }
  burn_rate_rules = var.burn_rate_rules
  notifications= var.notifications
  runbook= var.runbook_url
  disabled        = false
  group_by        = ["env"]
}
```

### Dynamic for_each Pattern (multi-endpoint)
```hcl
variable "endpoints" {
  type = map(object({
    uri= string
    latency_threshold = number
    reliability_target = number
  }))
  default = {
    "prompt" = { uri = "/v1/moderation/prompt", latency_threshold = 6000, reliability_target = 99.9 }
    "agent"  = { uri = "/v1/moderation/agent", latency_threshold = 8000, reliability_target = 99.9 }
    "image"  = { uri = "/v1/moderation/image", latency_threshold = 10000, reliability_target = 99.9 }
    "output" = { uri = "/v1/moderation/output", latency_threshold = 2000, reliability_target = 99.0 }
  }
}

resource "tome_slo" "reliability" {
  for_each    = var.endpoints
  name        = "${each.key} moderation outcomes are reliably processed"
  capability  = tome_capability.moderation[each.key].id
  service_id  = "responsible-ai-api"
  type        = "RELIABILITY"
  is_draft    = false
  objective   = each.value.reliability_target
  # ... queries parameterized by each.value.uri
}
```

### Exporting Existing UI Detectors to Terraform
```bash
# Method 1: terraform import
terraform import signalfx_detector.detector_container<detector_id>
terraform state show signalfx_detector.detector_container

# Method 2: UI "Show SignalFlow" → copy program_text

# Method 3: Este (Easy SignalFx to Terraform Exporter)
# Exports full dashboard/detector JSON → TF config
```

**Source**: [Terraform101](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120205bd0e85a126a434b8c9367824a85d50f/pages/6826519841), [The Fastest Way to Generate Complex Detectors in Terraform](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~581254739/pages/2393710739)

