## 6. Anti-Patterns to Avoid (from Atlassian Docs)

| Anti-Pattern | Correct Approach |
|---|---|
| Manually setting `mlflow.set_tracking_uri('databricks://ml-platform:ml-databricks')` | Use `start_mlflow_run(mls_args)` from SDK |
| Manually creating experiments in personal workspace | Let SDK auto-create at standardized path |
| Logging individual params one at a time in a loop | Use `mlflow.log_params(dict)` batch call |
| Storing large objects as parameters | Use `mlflow.log_artifact()` or `mlflow.log_dict()` |
| Nested dicts passed directly to `log_params()` | Flatten first using dot-notation keys |
| Not setting explicit `run_name` | Always provide descriptive `Model_<TS>` name |

