## Executive Summary

This research covers MLflow tracking API patterns for run construction, focusing on four key areas: run naming conventions (`Model_<TS>`), flattened parameter logging, per-segment metric emission, and nested run hierarchies. Findings are drawn from both official MLflow documentation patterns and Atlassian's internal ML Studio SDK implementation (the primary MLflow integration layer at Atlassian).

