## 8. Open Considerations

1. **Per-tenant metric explosion**: When logging per-tenant metrics for thousands of tenants, consider logging to ML Lens instead of MLflow (metric key count limits).
2. **Run ID propagation in nested workflows**: The `RunRecordAlias` table links parent↔child, but cron-scheduled runs have known gaps — the AI must verify run linkage before assuming parent-child relationship exists.
3. **Experiment namespace isolation**: Platform-created experiments follow `/mlflow/{workflow_type}/{usecase}/{name}` — the `MlFlowMetricsEmitter.isPlatformCreatedExperiment()` function validates this format.[0m
