This research covers the full Production Reliability + AI Gateway Ops stack for the SRE AI Employee role, specifically the `responsible-ai-api` codebase and associated observability/operations infrastructure. Findings are drawn from Bitbucket repository analysis, internal Confluence documentation, Jira issues, and related architecture documents.

