## Cross-Cutting Findings

### Codebase Structure (`atlassian/responsible-ai-api`)

**Key paths identified from documentation:**
```
responsible-ai-api/
├── src/
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── v1/moderation/
│   │   │   ├── agent_moderation_controller.py
│   │   │   └── image_moderation_controller.py
│   │   └── healthcheck.py (~258LoC)
│   ├── service/moderation/
│   │   ├── agent/agent_moderation.py
│   │   └── prompt/prompt_moderation.py
│   ├── inference_models/error_handling.py  # centralized fail-open
│   └── feature_service.py  # feature gates
├── operations/terraform/
│   ├── dashboard.tf# 17 charts, 0 detectors
│   └── main.tf
├── archetype-descriptor.yaml  # scaling config
├── .agents/project.md  # known failure modes
└── agentic-ops-logs/# chronological ops logs
```

### Feature Gates Pattern (Statsig)
All operational changes use feature gates with metadata:
- `rai_api_enable_cascade_moderation` — master cascade switch
- `rai_api_agent_moderation_fail_open` — fail-open kill-switch
- `rai_enable_teamserve_primary` — infrastructure routing
- `rai_api_enable_image_moderation_v1` — model version toggle

### Observability Stack
- **SignalFx:** Metrics + (soon) detectors
- **Splunk:** Log aggregation + error queries
- **OpsGenie:** Paging + rotation
- **Sauron:** IaC deployment for SignalFx artifacts
- **Pollinator:** Synthetic monitoring (healthchecks)

### Key Incident Patterns (4-week window)
| Pattern | Frequency | Impact | Auto-detection? |
|---------|-----------|--------|-----------------|
| Teamserve DEADLINE_EXCEEDED | 4 SEV-2 | Fail-open (bounded) | ❌ None |
| OTel sidecar race | 1 | ALB 5xx burst | ❌ None |
| SageMaker tenant burst | 2 | 503 flood (6-8k/min) | ❌ None |
| Agent moderation fail-closed | 1 | Rovo blocked | ❌ None |
| P99 latency escape | 1 | All callers degraded | ❌ None |

**Critical gap:** 0/7 incidents caught by automated paging. All discovered by user-report or proactive sweep.

