## Executive Summary

This report covers the evaluation frameworks (rovo-eval and AIX-eval) available at Atlassian, their APIs, architecture, and the statistical/ML methodology needed for multi-seed aggregation, k-fold/stratified evaluation, slice analysis, calibration metrics (ECE/Brier), fairness metrics (EO/DPD), and bootstrap confidence intervals. The research combines internal Atlassian documentation with industry-standard frameworks and methodologies.

