## 8. MLE Agent Autonomous Retraining — The Receiving End of the Hand-Off

### What it is
The MLE agent (Digital MLE) is designed to own the retraining execution autonomously, receiving trigger signals from the drift detection system.

### How it applies — The Hand-Off Contract to Subtask-2

The SOP-1 trigger phase **emits** a structured retraining request that the MLE agent/retraining stack **consumes**. The contract should include:

```json
{
  "trigger_event": {
    "trigger_type": "drift_confirmed",
    "trigger_source": "ml_lens_alert",
    "alert_id": "...",
    "timestamp": "2026-05-25T03:00:00Z"
  },
  "drift_evidence": {
    "model_id": "rai-ft-content-filter-v2-3-3",
    "pipeline_name": "rai_moderation_pipeline",
    "drift_metrics": [
      {
        "feature_name": "prompt_embedding",
        "drift_test": "cosine",
        "drift_value": 0.55,
        "threshold": 0.60,
        "reference_window": "30d_rolling"
      },
      {
        "feature_name": "output_distribution",
        "drift_test": "ks",
        "drift_value": 0.15,
        "threshold": 0.10,
        "reference_window": "training"
      }
    ],
    "confirmation_stage": "input_high_output_high",
    "priority": "P0"
  },
  "retraining_config": {
    "ml_studio_workflow_id": "...",
    "ml_studio_blueprint_id": "...",
    "training_data_window": "last_30d",
    "evaluation_baseline": "current_production_model",
    "quality_gates": {
      "min_f1": 0.75,
      "max_false_positive_rate": 0.05,
      "max_latency_p95_ms": 300
    },
    "deployment_mode": "manual_approval_required"
  },
  "operational_context": {
    "circuit_breaker_status": "closed",
    "current_error_rate": 0.02,
    "active_hot_tickets": [],
    "fail_open_active": false
  }
}
```

### Autonomy Boundaries (🟢/🟡/🔴 model)

| Action | Autonomy Level | Description |
|--------|---------------|-------------|
| Detect drift, compute metrics | 🟢 Autonomous | No human needed |
| Confirm drift (two-stage) | 🟢 Autonomous | Algorithmic verification |
| Emit trigger event to StreamHub | 🟢 Autonomous | Event emission |
| Initiate retraining workflow | 🟡 Notify + Proceed | Slack notification, auto-proceed |
| Execute training run | 🟡 Notify + Proceed | MLE agent runs autonomously (≤12h) |
| Evaluate trained model | 🟢 Autonomous | Quality gate comparison |
| Deploy to production | 🔴 Human Required | Manual approval always required |

**Source**: [Digital MLE: AI Employee Vision](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202027e1af5d30e94112880666ee62f9277a/pages/7051610727/Digital+MLE+AI+Employee+Vision), [AIF (PAI) L3-O1-KR1: AI Employee](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/aifun/pages/6978208776/AIF+PAI+L3-O1-KR1+AI+Employee), [AI Lab Review5/14](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/LAB/pages/7036087684/AI+Lab+Review+5+14)

