| **Source** | [AI Gateway Internal LLMs Routing](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5871499558), [AI Gateway Deep Research Report](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120203d68974c84a8453ab01c35740e7b4416/pages/7068910538), [Policy-Driven Model Routing](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/7001278725), [Heimdall scaling](https://hello.jira.atlassian.cloud/browse/COMMIT-24446) |

