## 3. Summary Matrix — Existing vs. New

| Capability (a–h) | Existing Tool Coverage | Gap → New Component | Type |
|---|---|---|---|
| **(a)** ML Lens drift query | ML Lens has APIs but no agent-facing tool | **ml-lens-query-tool** | Tool |
| **(b)** SignalFx detectors-as-code + SLOs | Sauron deploys TF; no authoring tool | **signalfx-detector-authoring-tool** | Tool |
| **(c)** Drift-triggered retraining | ML Lens alerts exist; no trigger automation | **drift-retraining-trigger-skill** | Skill |
| **(d)** Circuit-breaker controller | Feature gates exist in code; no management tool | **circuit-breaker-controller-skill** + **circuit-breaker-tool** | Skill + Tool |
| **(e)** Incident response SOP-3 | JSM Ops + Slack exist; no orchestrated workflow | **incident-response-sop3-skill** | Skill |
| **(f)** RAI-API ops runbook + moderation pipeline | Runbook stale; two-stage pipeline being built | **rai-ops-runbook-skill** + **moderation-pipeline-tool** | Skill + Tool |
| **(g)** Per-tenant rate-limit configurator | Pattern known; not yet implemented in RAI API | **rate-limit-configurator-tool** | Tool |
| **(h)** AI Gateway routing config | Gateway exists; no agent-facing config tool | **ai-gateway-routing-tool** | Tool |

