## 8. Key Infrastructure Components

### 8.1 Storage Layer

| Component | Online | Offline |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| **Tecton** | DynamoDB (multi-region) | S3/Parquet/Delta Lake |
| **MLFS** | ERS (Entity Relationship Store) + Redis cache | Delta Lake (ML Studio derived tables) |

### 8.2 Compute Layer

| Component | Tecton | MLFS |
|-----------|--------|------|
| Batch | Spark on Databricks | ML Studio Spark workflows |
| Stream | Spark Streaming | Flink (via Eureka) |
| Orchestration | Tecton Materialisation Orchestrator | MLFS Job Orchestrator + ML Studio |

### 8.3 Auth & Governance

| Aspect | Tecton | MLFS |
|--------|--------|------|
| Auth | TECTON_API_KEY | ASAP (Atlassian standard) |
| Access control | Workspace-level | Feature View + Feature Service level |
| Data governance | Limited | Full UGC support, PMR, data classification |
| Perimeters | Commercial only | Commercial + BlueBird + FedRamp + IC |

