## (f) Responsible-AI-API Ops Runbook Skill + Two-Stage Moderation Pipeline Tool

### What It Is
A dual-component system: (1) a skill that encodes the responsible-ai-api operational runbook (health checks, error diagnosis, scaling actions), and (2) a tool that operates the two-stage moderation pipeline (LLaMA 3.1 8B → GPT-OSS Safeguard 20B).

### How It Works (from internal docs)

**Two-Stage Prompt Moderator Architecture** (from [Two-Stage Prompt Moderator Design](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120202437cfa6229b4f95a58ffcf2c483eb04/pages/7064183361)):

| Dimension | Stage1: LLaMA 3.1 8B | Stage 2: GPT-OSS Safeguard 20B |
|-----------|------------------------|-------------------------------|
| P25/P50/P90Latency | ~100ms /200ms / 500ms | 250ms / 350ms / 500ms |
| ALLOW Precision | 72.0% | **96.0%** |
| ALLOW Recall | 23.5% | **87.5%** |
| DISALLOW Precision | 12.4% | **56.3%** |
| DISALLOW Recall | 54.1% | **81.7%** |
| Throughput/instance | ~4QPS | **~10 QPS** |
| Blocking Rate | 0.30% | 0.25% |

**Pipeline Logic**:
- Stage 1 (fast): ~100% recall, ~2% blocking rate → flags all potentially harmful content
- Stage 2 (precise): Filters Stage 1's2% down to <0.35% end-to-end blocking rate with >95% precision
- 98% of traffic passes Stage 1 without hitting Stage 2

**Service Health Monitoring** (from [Morning Status Report](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/LAB/pages/6893938536)):
- 22/22 instances healthy, all InService
- AZ balanced across us-east-1a /1b / 1c
- Common error patterns: gRPC DEADLINE_EXCEEDED, 429 Too Many Requests, Triton INTERNAL
- Fail-open path: bounded customer impact when TeamServe is degraded

**Moderation Categories** (V2.3_v2,10categories):
1. Violence/Harassment,2. Hate/Discrimination, 3. Misinformation, 4. Sexual Content, 5. Illegal Activity, 6. Self-harm, 7. Jailbreak/Prompt Injection, 8. Intellectual Property, 9. Politics, 10. PII

**Feature Gates**:
- `rai_api_enable_gptoss_safeguard` — controls Stage 2 model
- `rai_api_should_fail_open_agent_moderation` — kill-switch for agent endpoint

### Tool + Skill Specification

