|-------|-------|
| **Name (Skill)** | `rai-api-ops-runbook` |
| **Name (Tool)** | `moderation-pipeline-ops` |
| **Purpose** | Skill: diagnose RAI service issues, execute scaling/rotation actions. Tool: control two-stage pipeline configuration, model routing, threshold adjustment |
| **Autonomy Tier** | Skill: 🟢 diagnosis autonomous,🟡 action with confirmation. Tool: 🟡 config changes require confirmation |
| **Leveraged Tools** | Splunk (logs), SignalFx (metrics), Switcheroo (feature gates), AI Gateway SDK, TeamServe gRPC |
| **New-Tool Justification** | Complex two-stage pipeline needs operational tooling for stage routing, threshold tuning, and fail-open control beyond raw API calls |
| **Inputs (Skill)** | `check_type` (health|errors|capacity), `time_window`, `use_case_filter` |
| **Inputs (Tool)** | `action` (route_stage1_only|route_both_stages|adjust_threshold|toggle_gate), `gate_name`, `parameters` |
| **Outputs** | Service health report, error classification, action confirmation, pipeline state |
| **SOP Linkage** | §3.2 AI Gateway moderation; §4.1 runbooks; §4.3 operations; §10.5 guardrails |

