| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Name** | `ai-gateway-routing-config` |
| **Purpose** | View and modify AI Gateway routing config: model selection, fallback chains, vendor policies, feature gates, AZ rotation |
| **Autonomy Tier** | 🟡 Human-confirm for routing changes; 🟢 autonomous for read/status queries |
| **Leveraged Tools** | Shipyard config API, Switcheroo (feature gates), AI Gateway admin API, Heimdall |
| **New-Tool Justification** | 204 models × 7 vendors × 400+ use cases = high configuration complexity; AI agent can navigate and validate routing decisions |
