## 6. Service Descriptor Integration (Deployment)

### 6.1 V3 Service Descriptor Pattern (for Micros)

```yaml
# service.sd.yml
resources:
  - name: my-sm-endpoint
    type: sm-endpoint
    attributes:
      container: huggingface-pytorch-inference:2.0.0-transformers4.28.1-gpu-py310-cu118-ubuntu20.04
      package: <component-uuid>:<version-id-or-tag>
      scaling:
        min: 1
        max: 4
        instance: ml.g5.xlarge
```

Alternative format:
```yaml
resources:
  - name: my-sm-endpoint
    type: sm-endpoint
    attributes:
      container: <container-image>
      component: <component-uuid>
      version: <version-id-or-tag>
```

### 6.2 Rollback Pattern
Rollback is achieved by updating `versionTag` in the `.sd.yml` to point to a previous version, then redeploying through Spinnaker.

