## 8. V2 → V3 Migration Context

### 8.1 Timeline
- **Now**: V2 API deprecated
- **June 30, 2026**: V2 API removed and unavailable
- **August 2026**: All active model deployments migrated to V3

### 8.2 Key Conceptual Changes

| V2 | V3 | Notes |
|----|-----|-------|
| `ModelGroup` | `Component` (under a Namespace) | Components have explicit `type` |
| `ModelVersion` | `Version` | Multiple artifacts per version |
| `ModelVersionTag` | `Tag` | Created separately from version |
| `packageName` (single tar.gz) | `artifactIds` (array of UUIDs) | Multi-artifact support |
| `businessUnit` | Namespace hierarchy | Use namespaces for organization |
| `userMetadata` (free-form dict) | Data classification + labels + tags | Structured metadata |
| Minimal permissions | AD-group-based fine-grained permissions | First-class security |

### 8.3 Naming Conventions

| Entity | Convention | Example |
|--------|-----------|---------|
| Namespace | `lowercase-kebab-case` | `search-relevance.models` |
| Component | `mixed-Case (with FQN)` | `search-relevance.RankerModel` |
| Tags | Max 25 chars, lowercase + numbers | `v1.0.0`, `production`, `latest` |
| Labels | `lowercase` | `release`, `env=prod` |

**Source**: [Deprecating Model Registry V2 API](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2026/03/20/6650530784), [Tarot V2 to V3 Migration overview](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6078843565)

