## 11. Related Infrastructure & Integration Points

| System | Integration Role |
|--------|-----------------|
| **ML Studio** | Orchestrates training → packaging → registration workflows as DAGs |
| **Deployment Store** | Pulls artifacts from Tarot → replicates to SageMaker/TEAMServe S3 |
| **DMP (metadata-gatekeeper)** | Gates production deployments based on compliance attestations |
| **Micros** | Reads service descriptors, provisions SageMaker/TEAMServe endpoints |
| **Spinnaker** | Deployment pipeline automation |
| **StreamHub** | Event bus for artifact registration events |
| **Object Store (TDP OS)** | Storage backend for UGC artifacts with data residency |
| **Bitbucket Pipelines** | CI/CD integration for compliant model registration |
| **Databricks/MLflow** | Training platform, experiment tracking, artifact source |

