## 12. SDK Module Structure (v0.8+)

```python
# Core modules
from atlassian_msp_sdk import ml_registry          # Plumbing: low-level registry operations
from atlassian_msp_sdk import launcher# Launchpad: ephemeral SageMaker endpoints
from atlassian_msp_sdk import msp                  # Legacy client (v2compat)
from atlassian_msp_sdk import registry             # Legacy registry (v2 compat)

# V3 ML Registry types
from atlassian_msp_sdk.ml_registry.types import Attribution, Classification
from atlassian_msp_sdk.ml_registry.component import get_component

# High-level porcelain (planned/partial)
from atlassian_msp_sdk import promptz              # Prompt management
from atlassian_msp_sdk.downloader import HuggingFaceDownloader  # Model downloading

# Environment configuration
from atlassian_msp_sdk import use_staging# Switch to staging Tarot
```

### Key SDK Methods (V3ML Registry Module)

| Method | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `ml_registry.get_component(ref)` | Fetch component by FQN reference |
| `ml_registry.create_namespace(name, desc)` | Create new namespace |
| `ml_registry.create_component(name, desc)` | Create new component |
| `ml_registry.update_namespace_permissions(ref, perms)` | Modify namespace permissions |
| `ml_registry.update_component_permissions(ref, perms)` | Modify component permissions |
| `component.upload_artifact_files_as_tar_with_data_labels(...)` | Upload directory as tar.gz with labels |
| `component.upload_artifact_with_data_labels(data, filename, ...)` | Upload single file with labels |
| `component.upload_artifact_file_with_data_labels(file_path, ...)` | Upload file from path with labels |
| `component.create_version(description, artifacts, labels)` | Create immutable version |
| `component.download_artifact(artifact_id)` | Download artifact bytes |

**Source**: [Check out our new MSP SDK Release](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2025/04/17/5175681882), [ML Registry SDK Design](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4924999902), [MSP SDK v3 Tarot Integration Project Outline](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~485609285/pages/4913401201)

