## Cross-Cutting Patterns for AI Employee Encoding

### Autonomous vs. Human-Confirmation Decision Points

| Action | Autonomous? | Rationale |
|--------|-------------|-----------|
| Read metrics/status | ✅ Yes | No side effects |
| Post Slack status update | ✅ Yes | Informational |
| Create JSM alert | ✅ Yes | Standard response |
| Force circuit breaker OPEN | ✅ Yes (with conditions) | Safety-preserving (fail-open) |
| Activate kill-switch | ❌ Requires confirmation | Bypasses all moderation |
| Change rate limits | ⚠️ Conditional | Lower limits = autonomous; raise limits requires confirmation |
| Deploy/rollback |❌ Requires confirmation | Production state change |
| Merge Terraform PR | ❌ Requires confirmation | IaC change |
| Trigger retraining | ✅ Yes (training only) | Training is safe; deployment requires confirmation |
| Escalate severity | ⚠️ Conditional | Can suggest; IC confirms |

