## 10. Key Design Patterns for Skill Implementation

### Pattern A: Human Confirmation Points

Based on research, these are the points where human confirmation should be required vs. autonomous:

| Action | Human Confirmation Required? | Rationale |
|--------|------------------------------|-----------|
| Generate manifest from existing metadata | No — autonomous | Aggregation of existing data |
| Validate manifest schema | No — autonomous | Mechanical check |
| Set risk classification | **Yes** — confirm | Business impact judgment |
| Set invariant thresholds | **Yes** — confirm | Domain expertise needed |
| Trigger staging deployment | No — autonomous | Low blast radius |
| Trigger production deployment | **Yes** — approve | High blast radius |
| Execute rollback on invariant violation | No — autonomous (if configured as `hard`) | Time-critical safety |
| Modify rollback strategy | **Yes** — confirm | Changes safety envelope |

### Pattern B: Risk-Based Soak Time Mapping

```yaml
risk_to_soak_mapping:
  low-risk:    # Minor weight update, same architecture
    staging: 1h
    production_first_region: 30m
    production_remaining: 15m
  medium-risk: # New model version, same architecture
    staging: 6h
    production_first_region: 2h
    production_remaining: 1h
  high-risk:   # New architecture or major change
    staging: 24h
    production_first_region: 4h
    production_remaining: 2h
    manual_approval: true
```

### Pattern C: Invariant Taxonomy for ML

Based on canary analysis patterns and ML-specific needs:

| Category | Metric Type | Example | Enforcement |
|----------|-------------|---------|-------------|
| **Latency** | Infrastructure | P99 inference time | Hard — auto-rollback |
| **Error Rate** | Infrastructure | 5xx / total requests | Hard — auto-rollback |
| **Throughput** | Infrastructure | Requests/sec minimum | Soft — alert |
| **Quality** | Model | Online NDCG/MRR regression | Hard — auto-rollback |
| **Resource** | Infrastructure | GPU memory utilization | Soft — alert + scale |
| **Drift** | Data | PSI/KS on input features | Soft — alert + retrain |
| **Fairness** | Model | EO/DPD per segment | Soft — alert + review |

