## Synthesis: Proposed ORBIT Read/Write Skill Operations

### Read Operations (Context Bootstrap)

| Operation | Input | Output | When |
|-----------|-------|--------|------|
| `orbit.getContextPack` | `{userId, scope, purpose, roleType, budgets}` | `ContextPackV1` | Agent instantiation |
| `orbit.getDelta` | `{userId, sinceSnapshotId}` | Delta entries | Agent resuming after pause |
| `orbit.resolveEntity` | `{query, userId}` | Ranked entity candidates | Disambiguation during execution |

### Write Operations (Cumulative Learning)

| Operation | Input | Output | When |
|-----------|-------|--------|------|
| `memory.recordStep` | `{conversationId, entry, scope, agentId}` | Confirmation | Every significant action |
| `memory.consolidate` | `{conversationId, trigger}` | Episodic summary | Task completion |
| `memory.promotePlan` | `{intent, planContent, contextKeys}` | Golden Plan ID | Evaluation pipeline (async) |
| `spec.appendConstraint` | `{serviceAri, constraint, confidence}` | Updated Spec | After validated learning |
| `orbit.emitLearningSignal` | `{agentId, taskId, scope, learningPayload}` | Signal ID | Task completion |

### Human Confirmation Requirements

| Operation | Autonomy Tier | Confirmation Required |
|-----------|---------------|----------------------|
| Read context pack | 🟢 Green | No — always allowed |
| Write to L1 journal | 🟢 Green | No — always append |
| Consolidate to L2 | 🟢 Green | No — automated |
| Promote to L3 Golden Plan | 🟡 Yellow | Evaluation pipeline (automated quality gate) |
| Update Service Spec | 🟡 Yellow | Human review for safety-critical changes |
| Modify ORBIT rankings directly | 🔴 Red | Never — rankings are ML-driven, not agent-writable |

