## Executive Summary

This research covers the three core components of capability (j) in the ML Lifecycle Execution Stack: (1) canary and shadow rollout mechanisms across TEAMServe, Triton, and SageMaker; (2) feature-flag gating for ML model deployments; and (3) post-deployment invariant verification patterns. The findings are drawn from Atlassian's internal infrastructure documentation, real migration playbooks, and platform-level tooling.

