## 7. Human Confirmation vs Autonomous Execution Boundaries

| Action | Autonomy Level |
|--------|---------------|
| Deploy model to staging/Launchpad | ✅ Autonomous |
| Configure shadow flag | ✅ Autonomous |
| Run shadow test and collect metrics | ✅ Autonomous |
| Analyze shadow parity results | ✅ Autonomous |
| Create Statsig experiment | ✅ Autonomous |
| Advance ramp from 0% → 1% |⚠️ Human confirmation |
| Advance ramp at each subsequent stage | ⚠️ Human confirmation (unless auto-ramp enabled) |
| Emergency rollback on invariant violation | ✅ Autonomous |
| Offboard old endpoint after full rollout | ⚠️ Human confirmation |
| Remove feature flag (cleanup) | ✅ Autonomous (after 1-week stability) |

