## 2. The Risk Taxonomy (Multi-Dimensional Classification)

### What It Is
The [RFC-002 AI SDLC Governance Framework](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/AISDLC/pages/6849219616) defines a formal risk taxonomy with four primary inputs:

| Input | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| **Scope** | Breadth of systems, repositories, environments, or users affected |
| **Criticality** | Potential business, operational, reliability, or safety impact of failure |
| **Sensitivity** | Degree of exposure to customer data, regulated data, secrets, security-sensitive logic |
| **Reversibility** | Ease, speed, and completeness with which an action can be rolled back |

### Risk Classes and Autonomy Ceilings

| Risk Class | Characteristics | Autonomy Ceiling |
|-----------|-----------------|------------------|
| **Low** | Narrow scope, low criticality, low sensitivity, easily reversible | L4-L5 (🟢 eligible) |
| **Moderate** | Bounded scope, moderate criticality, limited sensitivity, reversible with effort | L3-L4 (🟡 likely) |
| **High** | Broader impact, significant reliability/security implications, limited reversibility | L2-L3 (🟡-🔴) |
| **Restricted** | Highly sensitive, regulated, security-critical, or difficult to reverse | L0-L2 (🔴 always) |

**Core policy**: No action may exceed the autonomy ceiling of its current risk class without a documented exception + evidence + approval.

### Risk Engine Inputs (from Autonomous Approval Verification System)

The [Autonomous Approval Verification System](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~cknott/pages/6676398058) details the Risk Engine inputs:

```
Risk Engine Inputs:
├── Service criticality (tier metadata)
├── Blast radius (dependency graph + files touched)
├── Data sensitivity (classification tags)
├── Reversibility score (rollback mechanism assessment)
└── Incident history correlation (past incidents in affected area)

Risk Engine Outputs:
├── Risk tier (low / medium / high)
├── Required evidence bundle (what proofs are needed)
└── Allowed rollout mode (direct merge / canary / progressive only)
```

**Source:** [Autonomous Approval Verification System](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~cknott/pages/6676398058)

