### 5.3 AI-Powered PIR Auto-Drafting (ICC PRD)

**What it is**: Atlassian's product vision for AI-accelerated PIR generation via Rovo, already in development (Phase 1 targeting ICC first release).

**How it works**:
- **Trigger**: When incident status changes to "resolved", a "Generate PIR" button becomes active
- **Data Sources**: All ICC (Incident Command Center) data — timeline, comms, RCA hypotheses, mitigation steps
- **Output**: Blameless, actionable PIR draft in Confluence
- **Regeneration**: "Regenerate PIR" button pulls newly available data; warns if partially edited

**Phase 1 Capabilities**:
