- Generate PIR button on resolved incidents
- Creates JSM PIR issue linked to incident
- Slack notification on PIR creation

**Phase 2 (Future)**:
- Interactive timeline-driven PIR
- AI-suggested root causes from similar incidents
- Auto-linked action items to Jira

**ML-Specific PIR Adaptation**:
For model deployment incidents, the PIR auto-drafter should additionally include:
- Model version that caused the incident
- Canary/shadow metrics at time of rollout
- Feature flag state and rollback timeline
- Training data quality signals that may have contributed
- Comparison of model metrics before/after incident

**Source**: [PRD — ICC: Post-Incident Review (PIR)](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ITSOL/pages/6841106051)

