- Generate automatically from MLflow + Jira + Bitbucket data

**Source**: [CoreML Weekly Dev Productivity Report](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120201713e7691d874080adce393bc77b0ada/pages/6864935878)

