**ML-Specific PIR Adaptation**:
For model deployment incidents, the PIR auto-drafter should additionally include:
- Model version that caused the incident
- Canary/shadow metrics at time of rollout
- Feature flag state and rollback timeline
- Training data quality signals that may have contributed
