| Session attribution (traceable to human) | Required | `actor.onBehalfOf` always present |
| Conversation logging (opt-in) | Required | Reasoning traces stored with configurable retention |
| Performance observability (<50ms overhead at p99) | Required | Async emission — zero overhead on critical path |

