## 3. SageMaker Pricing Dimensions

### 3.1 SageMaker Cost Structure

**What it is:** The cost model for SageMaker ML inference endpoints.

**Key pricing dimensions:**
- **Instance hosting cost** (dominant): `ml.<instance_type>` charged per hour
- **Data transfer** (negligible,<1% of hosting)
- **S3 storage** (model artifacts)
- **Monitoring jobs** (if enabled)

**SageMaker carries ~40% premium over raw EC2** per the TEAMServe Digest.

**Current SageMaker spend at Atlassian:**
- Peak: ~$30K/day list, ~$22K/day effective (after discounts)
- Annual: ~$11M list before migration
- Trending down as models migrate to TEAMServe (from $702K/month in Jan 2025 to ~$471K/month in Mar 2026)

**SageMaker Savings Plans:**
- Current commitment: $580/h (1-year All Upfront purchased Dec 2025)
- Coverage: ~95% of coverable usage
- Average SP discount: ~26%
- EDP (Enterprise Discount Program): 31% off list
- Global effective/list discount ratio observed: **0.4916** (≈50.8% off list)

**SageMaker instance pricing formula:**
```
monthly_cost_effective = hourly_effective_rate × 730 × instance_count
monthly_cost_list = hourly_list_rate × 730 × instance_count
effective_rate≈ list_rate × 0.4916(global average)
```

**Known SageMaker instance costs (list, us-east-1):**
| Instance | List$/hr | Use Case |
|----------|-----------|----------|
| ml.g5.xlarge | $1.408 | Standard GPU inference |
| ml.g5.2xlarge | ~$2.10 | Higher-memory GPU |
| ml.g5.12xlarge | ~$7.09 | Multi-GPU LLM |
| ml.g6.xlarge | $1.13 | Newer gen GPU |
| ml.c6i.2xlarge | ~$0.75 | CPU inference |
| ml.m5.xlarge | ~$0.46 | CPU/lightweight |
| ml.p5en.48xlarge | $47.85 | Large-scale training |

**How it applies:** The skill should:
- Maintain a SageMaker pricing lookup table (refreshed from `sagemaker_cost.csv` exported from Databricks)
- Apply the global discount ratio for instances without effective pricing
- Calculate both list and effective costs for comparison

**Source:** [SageMaker Cost Evaluation](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/1864880932), [DACI AWS SageMaker SP Purchase](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CFINOPS/pages/6051060383)

