**Tecton SDK patterns** (being deprecated by Nov 2026):
```python
from tecton import batch_feature_view, Entity, Aggregation
@batch_feature_view(
    sources=[source], entities=[user], mode="batch",
    aggregations=[Aggregation(column="score", function="avg", time_window="1d")],
    ttl="30d"
)
def user_features(df): return df[["id", "score", "created_at"]]
```

**Migration Pattern**: Feature flag gating between Tecton and MLFS reads, shadow testing, then cutover
- **Source**: [Tecton to MLFS Migration Roadmap](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6068686994)

