## Executive Summary

This research identifies internal Atlassian codebases, SDKs, APIs, and patterns that wrap the named platforms in the ML Lifecycle Execution Stack. Despite code-search MCP tools being unavailable (401 auth errors), comprehensive enterprise search yielded rich documentation of internal wrappers, SDKs, CLI tools, and integration patterns across all12 capability areas. The findings below are organized by capability domain with concrete patterns, repository names, API surfaces, and reusable abstractions.

