## 3. Tecton SDK & MLFS Client

### Internal Wrappers Discovered

**MLFS Java SDK** (`com.atlassian.mlp.featurestore:java-client-sdk`)
- **What it is**: Java client for reading features from MLFS (replacing Tecton Java client)
- **How it works**:
  ```kotlin
  implementation("com.atlassian.mlp.featurestore:java-client-sdk:0.0.36")
  @EnableMLFeatureStoreSDK
  class Application
