## 9. Spinnaker & Deployment Manifests

### Internal Patterns

**Spinnaker Pipeline Configuration** (`default-pipelines.spinnaker.yaml`):
```yaml
pipelines:
  - template: safeRelease
    throughput: high
    overrides:
      - applyTo:environmentTypes: [prod]rollout:
          canaryConfigIds:
            - spinnaker-default-5xx- my-custom-detector-IDonCanaryAnalysisFailure: manual
```

**Progressive Rollout Pattern**:
- Default percentages: [1, 5, 10, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100]
- Stage intervals: 10min (5 min grace + 5 min canary analysis)
- Canary analysis: Mann Whitney U test on baseline vs canary metrics
- Auto rollback if canary analysis fails (5xx error rate)

**Service Descriptor** (Micros `sd.yml`):
- Defines service resources including SageMaker endpoints
- Uploaded to Config Registry, Spinnaker detects and triggers pipeline
- `atlas spin service-descriptor upload --file sd.yml --service=<name>`

**Canary Config** (`canary-config.yml`):
- Custom SFX detector definitions
- Reference format: `<service-name>-detector-<detector-id>`

**Source**: [Spinnaker Reference](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ITSOL/pages/6976550550), [Canary Deployment Implementation Guide](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120203751105336c748498809ee74d33626f3/pages/6372694534)

