- Inefficient allocation (high cost/invocation ratio)
- GPU underutilization — consolidation via multi-container endpoints
- Instance optimization: load testing to find optimal instance type (e.g., g5.4xlarge > g5.xlarge at 60% price premium but 4x throughput)

