**Description**: Create the Production Reliability + AI Gateway Ops + Symphony Governance Stack — skills and tools the AI MLE needs to keep models healthy in production, operate Atlassian's responsible-ai-api patterns, and execute within Symphony/ORBIT/policy guardrails. This covers Clusters A (Production Observability/Drift/Incident), E (AI Gateway / Moderation Patterns / responsible-ai-api ops), and H (Symphony Governance, Autonomy, ORBIT, Policy Compliance, Day-One Bootstrap). Shared infra justification: all sit on top of ML Lens + SignalFx telemetry surfaces, the Symphony/ORBIT runtime, audit log sink, policy pack, and the responsible-ai-api production patterns (rate limit, circuit breaker, fail-open, AZ rotation, sidecar decoupling). Specific candidates: (a) ML Lens query tool — drift metrics (KS/KL/cosine ≥ 0.60 NLP floor), data-quality + model-perf + system-health dashboards; (b) SignalFx detectors-as-code authoring tool with per-endpoint SLOs encoded in IaC; (c) Drift-triggered retraining trigger skill (SOP-1 trigger phase, hands off to Subtask 2 stack for retrain); (d) Circuit-breaker controller skill+tool (20% / 60s window) + fail-open kill-switch; (e) Incident response SOP-3 skill — Slack ack, severity classification, cross-correlation, 30-min status cadence, escalation rules; (f) responsible-ai-api ops runbook skill + two-stage moderation pipeline (LLaMA 3.1 8B → GPT-OSS Safeguard 20B) operations tool; (g) Per-tenant token-bucket rate-limit configurator tool; (h) AI Gateway routing config tool (OpenAI/Anthropic/Bedrock/Gemini/internal); (i) Symphony Orchestrator interface skill (Watch→Bootstrap→Execute→Supervise→Close→Learn lifecycle); (j) ORBIT read/write skill — context bootstrap at instantiation + cumulative learning append on every task; (k) Policy compliance + autonomy-tier classifier skill enforcing §10.5 escalation thresholds (🟢/🟡/🔴) + change manifest validator (intent, non-goals, invariants, risk, test, rollback, monitoring); (l) Calibrated-uncertainty self-check skill (§3.4, §10.5 — 80% means right ~80%, separate measured vs inferred, explicit 'I don't know'); (m) Audit-log emitter tool for durable intent+evidence+approval+outcome trails; (n) Day-One bootstrap skill (§11.1 access + §11.2 document ingest + §11.3 first tasks). Each new tool MUST justify why existing tools (per Subtask 1's Association Map) are insufficient. Reference §1, §2.1, §2.7, §2.9 (PIR), §3.2 (AI Gateway, moderation), §3.4 soft competencies, §4.1 (runbooks), §5.1 (observability + orchestration), §5.3 (responsible-ai-api), §6.3 (SOP-3), §7 collaboration, §9 (challenges), §10.5 guardrails, §11 day-one of the role document.

**Todos**:
- Research APIs/CLIs for ML Lens, SignalFx detectors-as-code, Symphony Orchestrator, ORBIT, AI Gateway, responsible-ai-api (codebase), JSM Ops, Slack, Launchpad, feature flags
