- Specify Symphony lifecycle skill + ORBIT context skill (bootstrap + cumulative learning) — §1, §11.1, §11.2
- Specify autonomy-tier classifier + change-manifest validator + audit-log emitter + calibrated-uncertainty self-check (§10.5)
- Specify Day-One bootstrap skill that orchestrates §11.1-§11.3 (access, ingest, first tasks 5-6)
- For each new skill, list which existing tools (from Subtask 1) it leverages and any additional new tools needed
